                                "sense_id": "9d2d7b4d-1290-3a55-9ee1-8e77e8dba086",
                                "text": "He said, \"Though the law did not positively allow the destroying such base-born children, yet it held them to be the children of nobody; that the Church considered them as the children of nobody; and that at the best, they ought to be brought up to the lowest and vilest offices of the commonwealth.\""
                            }
